3. Both the Original Message and the New Message transmitted the exact same values in all the following
fields:
a. DE 2 (Primary Account Number [PAN])
b. DE 7 (Transmission Date and Time)
c. DE 11 (Systems Trace Audit Number [STAN])
d. DE 32 (Acquiring Institution ID Code)
e. DE 33 (Forwarding Institution ID Code)
f. DE 42 (Acceptor ID)
4. The New Message was submitted to the Mastercard network no sooner than 60 seconds after the Original
message and no later than 24 hours after the Original Message.
