definitions
Informational
Acquirer: Mandated
Acquirers (Originating Institutions) must be prepared to receive an Authorization Request Response/0110 or
Financial Transaction Request Response/0210 message with decline response code 94 (Duplicate transmission
detected) in DE 39 (Response Code) result when a MoneySend Payment Transaction or Gaming Payment
Transaction is duplicated.
Acquirers (Originating Institutions) must support three new values in data element (DE) 48 (Additional Data:
Private Use), subelement 84 (Merchant Advice Code), shown in the specification changes section of this
announcement.
Issuer: Informational
When Mastercard detects a duplicate MoneySend Payment Transaction or Gaming Payment Transaction
message, Mastercard will respond to the originator with decline response code value 94 (Duplicate transmission
detected) in DE 39 (Response Code). No advice message is sent to the Issuer (Receiving Institution).
Issuers (Receiving Institutions) should be aware of the new Merchant Advice Code values as described in the
Data Element tables in this release announcement.
